,{"au":["穆文煕"],"cls":"zm0321","direction":"in","dyn":"明","id":"d59f2nhga3nm","juan":30,"relation":"text_carried_by","title":"春秋左傳評苑"},{"au":["凌稚隆"],"cls":"zm0076","direction":"in","dyn":"明","id":"d59f2nifjx8h","juan":70,"relation":"text_carried_by","title":"春秋左傳評注測義"},{"au":["馮時可"],"cls":"zm0076","direction":"in","dyn":"明","id":"d59f2nl09ern","img":true,"juan":2,"nb":1,"relation":"text_carried_by","title":"左氏釋","txt":true},{"au":["陸粲"],"cls":"zm0076","direction":"in","dyn":"明","id":"d59f2nldddds","img":true,"juan":5,"nb":2,"relation":"text_carried_by","title":"左傳附注","txt":true},{"au":["盧文弨"],"direction":"in","dyn":"清","id":"d59f2o2mjq4h","juan":1,"relation":"text_carried_by","title":"春秋左傳注疏校正"},{"au":["蘇寬"],"direction":"in","id":"d59f2pscqbcx","juan":1,"relation":"text_carried_by","title":"春秋左氏傳義疏"},{"au":["何始真"],"cls":"zm0001","direction":"in","id":"d59f2psxbz0h","juan":12,"relation":"text_carried_by","title":"何始真春秋左氏區別"},{"direction":"in","id":"d59f2pt1pb7l","relation":"text_carried_by","title":"春秋左氏傳正義"},{"direction":"in","id":"d59f2pt39hxc","relation":"text_carried_by","title":"高貴鄉公左氏音"},{"direction":"in","id":"d59f2pt3kq2o","relation":"text_carried_by","title":"杜預左氏經傳集解"},{"direction":"in","id":"d59f2pt5g54w","juan":3,"relation":"text_carried_by","title":"左氏杜預評"},{"direction":"in","id":"d59f2pt5g5c1","relation":"text_carried_by","title":"左傳詁"},{"cls":"zm0076","direction":"in","id":"d59f2pt9708y","relation":"text_carried_by","title":"左氏廣誨蒙"},{"direction":"in","id":"d59f2pt9i874","relation":"text_carried_by","title":"春秋左氏傳經傳集解"},{"cls":"zm0076","direction":"in","id":"d59f2ptnjwn5","juan":1,"relation":"text_carried_by","title":"左傳約說"}],"_related_pages":2,"_related_total":233,"additional_titles":["春秋左氏傳","左氏傳","春秋左傳","左氏春秋"],"ai_note":"《漢志》著錄「《左氏傳》三十卷。左丘明，魯太史。」《左傳》與《春秋古經》的配合始於杜預。《左傳》屬古文學。關於作者，一般認為是與孔子同時期的左丘明，但今文學家說「左氏不傳《春秋》」。《左傳》的來源在漢朝有三種說法：王充認為發現於孔子壁；許慎認為是張苍所獻；班固認為藏於秘府被劉歆發現。來源：溫浚源《漢書藝文志講要》。 | 從 1evcsw7n15wjk 合併。原註：作者「晉杜預撰」補自《國立故宮博物院善本舊籍》目錄。 | 從 1evkamluciuww 合併。原註